hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2861","It is narrated from the report of 'Ali ibn Abi Talib (RA) from the Prophet (ﷺ) until he reached Wadi Muhassir, where his camel became frightened and knelt down until he had crossed the valley.\n\n**CHAPTER:**"
"2862","###\n It was narrated to us by Salam ibn Junadah, who said: Waki' narrated to us, from Sufyan. And it was narrated to us by Muhammad ibn Sufyan ibn Abi al-Zarad al-Ubali, who said: Abu 'Amir narrated to us, who said: Sufyan narrated to us. And it was narrated to us by Muhammad ibn al-'Ala', who said: Qubaysah narrated to us, from Sufyan, from Abu al"
